<view class="screen">
  <view class="page-kicker">REVIEW BEFORE GENERATION</view><view class="page-title">确认方案，再生成。</view><view class="page-intro">此页只读取已保存资料，不会调用 AI。与简图逐项核对后，才可提交任务。</view>
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading-state">正在读取当前方案…</view>
  <view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="error-state section">{{error}}<button class="secondary-action" bindtap="refresh">重新读取</button><button class="text-link" bindtap="back">返回项目修改资料</button></view>
  <block wx:elif="{{preview}}">
    <view class="section surface"><view class="small-label">{{preview.projectTitle}}</view><view class="section-title">{{preview.location.name}}</view><view class="summary-line">{{productLabel}}</view><view class="muted">{{dimensionLabel || '以各安装面已记录的尺寸为准'}}</view></view>
    <view class="section surface"><view class="section-title">材料与外观</view><view class="summary-line">主材：{{preview.location.material}}</view><view class="summary-line">表面：{{preview.location.finish || '未指定，按主材自然效果'}}</view><view class="summary-line">颜色：{{preview.location.color || '未指定，以主材要求为准'}}</view><view wx:if="{{preview.location.customerRequirements}}" class="summary-line">客户要求：{{preview.location.customerRequirements}}</view></view>
    <view class="section surface"><view class="section-title">工程师结构方案</view><view wx:if="{{preview.legacyStructure}}" class="notice">当前是纯文字结构方案，没有分面分格记录。请确认文字已完整描述关键数量、位置、转角与开启方向。</view><view wx:if="{{preview.structureSummary}}" class="structure-summary">{{preview.structureSummary}}</view><view wx:if="{{preview.location.structureNotes}}" class="structure-summary">补充说明：{{preview.location.structureNotes}}</view><view class="muted summary-line">仅检查录入完整性，不校验尺寸闭合、受力或施工安全。</view></view>
    <view class="section"><view class="section-title">对应现场照片 · {{preview.views.length}} 个角度</view><view wx:for="{{preview.views}}" wx:key="angle" class="photo-card"><image wx:if="{{item.previewUrl}}" class="source-image" src="{{item.previewUrl}}" mode="aspectFill" data-url="{{item.previewUrl}}" bindtap="previewImage" /><view wx:else class="notice">照片暂不可读取，请返回检查或重新加载。</view><view class="photo-caption">{{item.angle}}</view></view></view>
    <view class="section surface"><view class="section-title">工程师结构简图</view><view class="sketch-grid"><image wx:for="{{preview.sketches}}" wx:key="id" wx:if="{{item.previewUrl}}" src="{{item.previewUrl}}" mode="aspectFit" data-url="{{item.previewUrl}}" bindtap="previewImage" /></view><view class="notice">当前模型每个角度只接收对应现场照片与本页文字；简图与材质图片用于人工核对，不会被自动识别或作为多图同时输入。</view></view>
    <view class="section surface"><view class="section-title">逐项确认</view><checkbox-group bindchange="chooseChecks"><label class="check-row"><checkbox value="structure" checked="{{checkFlags.structure}}" color="#ae592e" disabled="{{submitting || submitted}}" /><text>已核对尺寸、分格、数量、转角、开启方向和避让要求。</text></label><label class="check-row"><checkbox value="materials" checked="{{checkFlags.materials}}" color="#ae592e" disabled="{{submitting || submitted}}" /><text>已核对客户材料、颜色、表面及其他已指定要求。</text></label><label class="check-row"><checkbox value="views" checked="{{checkFlags.views}}" color="#ae592e" disabled="{{submitting || submitted}}" /><text>已核对各角度现场照片与当前安装位置一致，且图片可正常查看。</text></label><label class="check-row"><checkbox value="usage" checked="{{checkFlags.usage}}" color="#ae592e" disabled="{{submitting || submitted}}" /><text>知道任务处理会消耗生图资源，AI 输出仍需审核，不能直接作为施工依据。</text></label></checkbox-group></view>
    <view class="action-row section"><button class="secondary-action" bindtap="back" disabled="{{submitting}}">返回修改</button><button class="primary-action" bindtap="submit" disabled="{{!confirmed || submitting || submitted}}" loading="{{submitting}}">{{submitted ? '已提交' : '确认并提交任务'}}</button></view>
  </block>
</view>
